<tr><td>Flood or surge exclusion</td><td>Damage was caused by rising water, not wind</td><td>Is there damage above the water line? Roof or window openings? Was a flood claim filed?</td></tr>
<tr><td>Wear and tear</td><td>Damage is from age or deterioration</td><td>Are there fresh creases, missing shingles or impact marks consistent with the storm date?</td></tr>
<tr><td>No wind-created opening</td><td>Rain entered without the building first being damaged</td><td>Does roof or wall damage line up with the interior stains?</td></tr>
<tr><td>Long-term leak or seepage</td><td>Water damage happened over weeks or months</td><td>When did the leak start? What do moisture readings and a plumber’s report show?</td></tr>
